==Trivia==
*Divine Cyclone appears to be based on [[Wikipedia:Seraph|Seraphim]]: high-ranking and extraordinarily powerful divine beings whose jobs it is to serve and worship God at His throne.
**Seraphim can be best described as "winged beasts"—often depicted with many eyes—whose very presence purifies evil by a burning and all-consuming flame, much like Divine Cyclone.
*[[Mini Angel Cyclone]]'s Japanese description states that she is Divine Cyclone's daughter.
*Although its English name starts with a "D", Divine Cyclone appears in stages called [[Wrath of A-Cyclone (Insane)|Wrath of A-Cyclone]] and [[Revenge of A-Cyclone (Deadly)|Revenge of A-Cyclone]]. This is likely attributable to poor localization, since Divine Cyclone's Japanese name is Angel Cyclone. The same also applies to its smaller variant, which is named "Mini Angel Cyclone" in [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] rather than "Mini Divine Cyclone" in accordance with the original.
*Divine Cyclone has the highest DPS, shortest range, fastest attack rate and biggest halo of all Angels.

